      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NAUGHTY NORM (1) had the drop on the lead from the rails draw last start but could only manage third, beaten 4 lengths (22.34) at this track in a Free For All over 390m. Can go on with it. HARA HACHI BU (6) found some support last start but struggled into fourth (22.37), beaten 4.5 lengths. Was in the money the start prior. Should be about the mark. DIMORA BIG BOY (3) boxed on well to finish third last time, beaten a long neck (22.79) behind Paw Yuri at Ballarat. Has never been out of the placings from three starts out of this box. Racing well and deserves a win. SKETCHY DEMOS (8) took up a forward position and go the job done last time out. Sure to run well again.",
